# DUB.SAR 1.0 Example: Ea-nasir Copper Assessment Revision (v1 -> v2)
# Difficulty: Exemplar
# Concept: Tablet Archive Derivation & Versioning
# Mode: Scholar (Latin transliteration)
#
# Purpose:
#   Derives a working draft from an existing archived tablet (ea-nasir-assessment v1),
#   mutates fields in working memory, and inscribes version 2 back to the archive.
#
# Expected Output:
#   ea-nasir-assessment

problem

    consult tablet "ea-nasir-assessment"

    derive from "ea-nasir-assessment" as working revised-assessment

    put "rejected" into revised-assessment at "verdict"

    inscribe revised-assessment as tablet "ea-nasir-assessment"

result

    "ea-nasir-assessment"
